description:
Given this was only a weekend hackathon, the project is just an exploratory look at trying out and getting familiarized with the features of Autonomous Worlds and MUD; 
Hackathons are great for encouraging yourself to learn new things!

I have an idea for an on-chain game but the scope is too big, so I want to try prototyping some of the smaller features in AW to see if it is something that I could use going forward
